PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E49D3

   1 a 0000 E49D3:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-49/P3] BARE/BARE member-vs-member (`na = nb').  If DR
   4 a 0006      admits all three spellings, D1/D2/D3 and E49B1 form a byte-
   5 a 0006      identical quartet (modulo module names) and the encoding
   6 a 0006      ignores qualification entirely; any byte difference in the
   7 a 0006      relocations or a refusal names a qualification effect the
   8 a 0006      ledger has never seen. */
   9 c 0006   dcl
  10 c 0006     1 rec,
  11 c 0006       2 na char(3),
  12 c 0006       2 nb char(3),
  13 c 0006       2 s2 char(2);
  14 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  15 c 0006   if na = nb then k = 1;
  16 c 001D   put list('K=', k);
  17 c 003F   stop;
  18 a 0042 end E49D3;

CODE SIZE = 0042
DATA AREA = 000C
FREE SYMS = 3888
END  COMPILATION
